.ez/*
# except a dependency marked `vendor = true` in ez.toml. ez's own Bend imports
# sha256 out of BEND_LIB, so a checkout with an empty BEND_LIB cannot check
# any Bend here, let alone run `ez fetch` to fill it. The allowlist line is
# the hash of that tree. `ez lock --upgrade` rewrites the line when the pin
# moves and lays the new tree beside it.
!.ez/lib
.ez/lib/*
!.ez/lib/0x0a5c2c95283e42e081da247c84debe18
bin/ez.bin
.claude/
